[indent]1.  诸葛尚先被命为先锋，首战即"匹马单枪，战退[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "师纂", "cat": "people"}]师纂[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "邓忠", "cat": "people"}]邓忠[/url][/color]"[/indent]
